{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/extras/desc_Title_Alt.png?t=1744741591\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/extras/scrapCollect.gif?t=1744741591\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Salvage Protocol</strong> is a single-player horror game about infiltrating abandoned space stations. Break anything in sight, recover valuable components, dodge traps and fight off terrifying monsters hiding in plain sight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And maybe one day YOU will pay off your debt to the S.R.P.O. mega-corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/extras/VentGameplay.gif?t=1744741591\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/extras/desc_Step_1_explore.png?t=1744741591\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sneak through vents, climb unstable structures and reactivate ancient machines to open new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every station is a handcrafted maze where death is lurking just around the corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/extras/smashGameplay.gif?t=1744741591\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/extras/desc_Step_2_salvage.png?t=1744741591\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>If it looks like you can break it, you probably can.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wreak havoc and collect scrap to satisfy S.R.P.O\u2019s endless appetite for worthless junk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/extras/desc_Step3.png?t=1744741591\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your hard earned credits to good use, upgrade your gear and buy new tools to make the job easier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/extras/desc_features.png?t=1744741591\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 handcrafted locations \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dangerous monsters and traps\ud83d\ude31</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of tools and upgrades \u2699\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Satisfying prop DESTRUCTION \ud83d\udca5</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The joy of paying of your debt (maybe) \ud83d\udcb8</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3358680?t=1744741591","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744741591","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/736095cfe94658fa8da83c3cb438b6811f18abd6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744741591","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/736095cfe94658fa8da83c3cb438b6811f18abd6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744741591","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3522930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358680/extras/desc_Title_Alt.png?t=1744741591\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste